  × Describe callback should not be async.
  
    1 │ /* should generate diagnostics */
  > 2 │ test.describe(async () => {});
      │ ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    3 │ test.describe((done) => {});
    4 │ test.describe(123);
  
  i Describe blocks are meant to organize tests, not contain asynchronous logic. Async operations should be placed within individual test callbacks.
  
  i Remove the async keyword from the describe callback.
  

```

